<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Thai Asia shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Thai Asia shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of the Thai Asia Fund Ltd has been suspended at the company's own request, the stock exchange said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The share closed on Wednesday at HK$3.575.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6933</p>
